  A MINIMUM-LENGTH DEBOUNCE CAN WORK only if the word episodes and the
  fragments sit in SEPARATE buckets. If the mass is spread smoothly there
  is no threshold that keeps one and drops the other, and the fix has to
  be hysteresis in AMPLITUDE rather than a minimum duration.

